=== Initial Switch States ===
[white plastic body Switch] Position: Down | Light Status:    OFF
[black plastic body Switch] Position: Up | Light Status:    ON

=== Interacting with Switches ===
Turning on the living room light...
Flipped UP -> The light turns ON.
[white plastic body Switch] Position: Up | Light Status:    ON

Turning off the bedroom light...
Flipped DOWN -> The light turns OFF.
[black plastic body Switch] Position: Down | Light Status:    OFF
